{"schema_version": "exam-answer-candidate-0.1", "answer_pair_id": "GK-SC-2008-Q010", "exam_id": "GK-SC-2008", "question_id": 10, "source_role": "answer_scoring_candidate", "candidate_status": "candidate_unverified", "candidate_extraction_method": "short_answer_field", "answer_candidate_text": "C", "answer_candidate_sha256": "6b23c0d5f35d1b11f9b683f0b0a617355deb11277d91ae091d399c655b87940d", "raw_answer_text_sha256": "6b23c0d5f35d1b11f9b683f0b0a617355deb11277d91ae091d399c655b87940d", "source_status": "unverified_local_provided", "source_pdf": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/2008年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）.pdf", "source_mineru_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/mineru_result/2008年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）/full.md", "source_answer_index": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2008/answers/answer_index.jsonl", "source_answer_bundle": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2008/answers/answer_bundle.md", "scoring_status": "not_available_as_official", "review_status": "needs_manual_review", "notes": ["short_field_requires_manual_confirmation"]}
{"schema_version": "exam-answer-candidate-0.1", "answer_pair_id": "GK-SC-2008-Q011", "exam_id": "GK-SC-2008", "question_id": 11, "source_role": "answer_scoring_candidate", "candidate_status": "candidate_unverified", "candidate_extraction_method": "raw_answer_field_unbounded", "answer_candidate_text": "11. （10分）\n\n(1）（4分）永乐元年被征召入朝，留下担任原来的官职。不久，又辞官离去。\n\n(2)(6分）使者到来，打开看到的全是经史书籍，丢下另一半未打开，才免于祸患，人们认为是崇高品行感应的结果。", "answer_candidate_sha256": "6d29da9060a955a07739e62ef4d4266494f386b3a75d170f5446c07935a81e6c", "raw_answer_text_sha256": "6d29da9060a955a07739e62ef4d4266494f386b3a75d170f5446c07935a81e6c", "source_status": "unverified_local_provided", "source_pdf": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/2008年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）.pdf", "source_mineru_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/mineru_result/2008年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）/full.md", "source_answer_index": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2008/answers/answer_index.jsonl", "source_answer_bundle": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2008/answers/answer_bundle.md", "scoring_status": "not_available_as_official", "review_status": "needs_manual_review", "notes": ["no_explicit_answer_marker", "manual_boundary_required", "candidate_unverified"]}
{"schema_version": "exam-answer-candidate-0.1", "answer_pair_id": "GK-SC-2008-Q012", "exam_id": "GK-SC-2008", "question_id": 12, "source_role": "answer_scoring_candidate", "candidate_status": "candidate_unverified", "candidate_extraction_method": "raw_answer_field_unbounded", "answer_candidate_text": "12.（8分）\n\n（1）（4分）写了两个层次。\n\n前四句为第一层次，主要写向往归隐的理由。由春花秋月引起先阴如箭之叹，由鸟啼雁归生出人情淡薄之慨。\n\n后几句为第二层次，主要写向往中的隐居生活。其中又分为两层，“留下”句至“秧肥”句为第一层，写归隐后的物质生活：“床边”之后的几句为第二层，写归隐后的精神生活。 人\n\n(2)（4分）①对偶，如“秋月”句对“春花”句等；②比喻，如将“人情”比作“云”，“风景”比为“箭”等；③夸张，将“风景”比为“箭”的同时又兼用了夸张的方法。", "answer_candidate_sha256": "c3e17aa6fc710c840567fb584d981d18d94974dcb217b24ded384eaf37c1f1c5", "raw_answer_text_sha256": "c3e17aa6fc710c840567fb584d981d18d94974dcb217b24ded384eaf37c1f1c5", "source_status": "unverified_local_provided", "source_pdf": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/2008年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）.pdf", "source_mineru_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/mineru_result/2008年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）/full.md", "source_answer_index": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2008/answers/answer_index.jsonl", "source_answer_bundle": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2008/answers/answer_bundle.md", "scoring_status": "not_available_as_official", "review_status": "needs_manual_review", "notes": ["no_explicit_answer_marker", "manual_boundary_required", "candidate_unverified"]}
{"schema_version": "exam-answer-candidate-0.1", "answer_pair_id": "GK-SC-2008-Q013", "exam_id": "GK-SC-2008", "question_id": 13, "source_role": "answer_scoring_candidate", "candidate_status": "candidate_unverified", "candidate_extraction_method": "raw_answer_field_unbounded", "answer_candidate_text": "13. （5分)\n\n(1) 俯足以畜妻子 凶年免于死亡 然后驱而之善\n\n阴阳割昏晓 决毗入归鸟\n\n(2)豁然开朗 有良田美池桑竹之属\n\n千古风流人物 惊涛拍岸 一时多少豪杰", "answer_candidate_sha256": "ed78ce5f31040ee49ae9683341a1554d0eaf4c6778999bdda4a87b0466504c15", "raw_answer_text_sha256": "ed78ce5f31040ee49ae9683341a1554d0eaf4c6778999bdda4a87b0466504c15", "source_status": "unverified_local_provided", "source_pdf": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/2008年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）.pdf", "source_mineru_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/mineru_result/2008年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）/full.md", "source_answer_index": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2008/answers/answer_index.jsonl", "source_answer_bundle": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2008/answers/answer_bundle.md", "scoring_status": "not_available_as_official", "review_status": "needs_manual_review", "notes": ["no_explicit_answer_marker", "manual_boundary_required", "candidate_unverified"]}
{"schema_version": "exam-answer-candidate-0.1", "answer_pair_id": "GK-SC-2008-Q014", "exam_id": "GK-SC-2008", "question_id": 14, "source_role": "answer_scoring_candidate", "candidate_status": "candidate_unverified", "candidate_extraction_method": "raw_answer_field_unbounded", "answer_candidate_text": "14. （4分）\n\n第一问（2分）：\n\n“怅惘”是指作者思念什刹海却只能在梦中相见的遗憾。\n\n第二问（2分）：\n\n表达了作者感伤怀旧的情绪和浓郁的乡愁情结。", "answer_candidate_sha256": "37963171c18eb9efde278b27d063affa6bbdf6e55dd04763b5fe66fcaa325e67", "raw_answer_text_sha256": "37963171c18eb9efde278b27d063affa6bbdf6e55dd04763b5fe66fcaa325e67", "source_status": "unverified_local_provided", "source_pdf": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/2008年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）.pdf", "source_mineru_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/mineru_result/2008年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）/full.md", "source_answer_index": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2008/answers/answer_index.jsonl", "source_answer_bundle": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2008/answers/answer_bundle.md", "scoring_status": "not_available_as_official", "review_status": "needs_manual_review", "notes": ["no_explicit_answer_marker", "manual_boundary_required", "candidate_unverified"]}
{"schema_version": "exam-answer-candidate-0.1", "answer_pair_id": "GK-SC-2008-Q015", "exam_id": "GK-SC-2008", "question_id": 15, "source_role": "answer_scoring_candidate", "candidate_status": "candidate_unverified", "candidate_extraction_method": "raw_answer_field_unbounded", "answer_candidate_text": "15. （6分）\n\n概括（2分）：\n\n①冬雪皎白，薄冰试步；②春天温柔，生机盎然：③夏天明媚，夕阳辉煌；④秋意渐深，秋荷摇曳。\n\n作用（4分）\n\n①具体表现了什刹海景色之美；②表达了作者对什刹海的喜爱之情。", "answer_candidate_sha256": "70a412cabd5981d05df30b239e5970dad8ec41db28bae624373ef0692491b342", "raw_answer_text_sha256": "70a412cabd5981d05df30b239e5970dad8ec41db28bae624373ef0692491b342", "source_status": "unverified_local_provided", "source_pdf": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/2008年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）.pdf", "source_mineru_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/mineru_result/2008年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）/full.md", "source_answer_index": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2008/answers/answer_index.jsonl", "source_answer_bundle": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2008/answers/answer_bundle.md", "scoring_status": "not_available_as_official", "review_status": "needs_manual_review", "notes": ["no_explicit_answer_marker", "manual_boundary_required", "candidate_unverified"]}
{"schema_version": "exam-answer-candidate-0.1", "answer_pair_id": "GK-SC-2008-Q016", "exam_id": "GK-SC-2008", "question_id": 16, "source_role": "answer_scoring_candidate", "candidate_status": "candidate_unverified", "candidate_extraction_method": "raw_answer_field_unbounded", "answer_candidate_text": "16. （4分）\n\n(1) (2分）指春天来了，什刹海的水充满了春意。\n\n(2) (2分）指夜晚的什刹海很关，能触发诗人的创作灵感。", "answer_candidate_sha256": "1805bc8e9bebf4a4da8a2ed1f3065d61e1f69564e750257a79c09d2d908250b7", "raw_answer_text_sha256": "1805bc8e9bebf4a4da8a2ed1f3065d61e1f69564e750257a79c09d2d908250b7", "source_status": "unverified_local_provided", "source_pdf": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/2008年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）.pdf", "source_mineru_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/mineru_result/2008年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）/full.md", "source_answer_index": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2008/answers/answer_index.jsonl", "source_answer_bundle": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2008/answers/answer_bundle.md", "scoring_status": "not_available_as_official", "review_status": "needs_manual_review", "notes": ["no_explicit_answer_marker", "manual_boundary_required", "candidate_unverified"]}
{"schema_version": "exam-answer-candidate-0.1", "answer_pair_id": "GK-SC-2008-Q017", "exam_id": "GK-SC-2008", "question_id": 17, "source_role": "answer_scoring_candidate", "candidate_status": "candidate_unverified", "candidate_extraction_method": "raw_answer_field_unbounded", "answer_candidate_text": "## 17. (8分)\n\n①一开始写“我爱水”照应了标题，并与文章的结尾相呼应；②一开始写“我爱水”，可由眼前之水过渡到故都之水，使行文自然巧妙；③文章的主旨是表达作者对什刹海的喜爱和思乡之情，因而写什刹海的篇幅比较多。", "answer_candidate_sha256": "3773045f26b944d2b7bcaae8463f492dbafc3b30486531449a2a296d4f482823", "raw_answer_text_sha256": "3773045f26b944d2b7bcaae8463f492dbafc3b30486531449a2a296d4f482823", "source_status": "unverified_local_provided", "source_pdf": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/2008年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）.pdf", "source_mineru_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/mineru_result/2008年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）/full.md", "source_answer_index": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2008/answers/answer_index.jsonl", "source_answer_bundle": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2008/answers/answer_bundle.md", "scoring_status": "not_available_as_official", "review_status": "needs_manual_review", "notes": ["no_explicit_answer_marker", "manual_boundary_required", "candidate_unverified"]}
{"schema_version": "exam-answer-candidate-0.1", "answer_pair_id": "GK-SC-2008-Q018", "exam_id": "GK-SC-2008", "question_id": 18, "source_role": "answer_scoring_candidate", "candidate_status": "candidate_unverified", "candidate_extraction_method": "raw_answer_field_unbounded", "answer_candidate_text": "## 18. （4分)\n\n举例：北京奥运会将惠及亚洲的旅游业。", "answer_candidate_sha256": "e8c2425fc3f0a4892b5e5d7a9fb3a691b17f72597e396b6b7121c7b383ed160d", "raw_answer_text_sha256": "e8c2425fc3f0a4892b5e5d7a9fb3a691b17f72597e396b6b7121c7b383ed160d", "source_status": "unverified_local_provided", "source_pdf": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/2008年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）.pdf", "source_mineru_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/mineru_result/2008年高考语文试卷（四川）（解析卷）/full.md", "source_answer_index": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2008/answers/answer_index.jsonl", "source_answer_bundle": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-SC-2008/answers/answer_bundle.md", "scoring_status": "not_available_as_official", "review_status": "needs_manual_review", "notes": ["no_explicit_answer_marker", "manual_boundary_required", "candidate_unverified"]}
